  {
   "id": "linear",
   "steps": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Stage 4: n over 2 calls, each up to log n, suggests n log n. The true cost is lower. A call on a node of height h costs O of h."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "head",
       "text": "Stage 4 of 7: building is linear"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "t2"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "a2"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "lin"
      },
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "lin[0]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "And at most n over 2 to the h plus 1 nodes have height h: half the nodes are leaves, a quarter have height 1, and so on."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "reveal",
       "target": "lin[1]"
      },
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "lin[1]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "The sum of h over 2 to the h converges to 2, so the total is O of n."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "reveal",
       "target": "lin[2]"
